      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "的和的平方．根据公式（2），得：",
        "$(10a^3-7ab^2)^2=(10a^3)^2+2(10a^3)\\cdot(-7ab^2)+(-7ab^2)^2$",
        "$=100a^6-140a^4b^2+49a^2b^4$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来推导把三项式的平方展开成多项式的公式．为此，把三项",
        "式写成两个项的和的形式：",
        "$(a+b+c)^2=((a+b)+c)^2=(a+b)^2+2(a+b)c+c^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "去括号：",
        "$(a+b)^2+2(a+b)c+c^2=a^2+2ab+b^2+2ac+2bc+c^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们得到公式：",
        "$(a+b+c)^2=a^2+b^2+c^2+2ab+2ac+2bc$．　　　　　　　　　（3）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "类似地可以推导含有任意项的多项式的平方公式．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "887",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "887．把二项式的平方写成多项式：",
        "а）$(x+y)^2$；　　　　б）$(p-q)^2$；　　　　в）$(b+3)^2$；",
        "г）$(a+5)^2$；　　　　д）$(10-c)^2$；　　　　е）$(y-7)^2$；",
        "ж）$(7-y)^2$；　　　　з）$(a+12)^2$；　　　　и）$(-x+5)^2$；",
        "к）$(-z-2)^2$；　　　　л）$(-n+4)^2$；　　　　м）$(-m-10)^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "888",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "888．利用图126说明公式：",
        "$(a+b)^2=a^2+2ab+b^2$．"
      ]
    },
