      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "889．证明下列等式是恒等式：",
        "а）$(x-y)^2=(y-x)^2$；",
        "б）$(-p-q)^2=(p+q)^2$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
